{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "0f7243f1b9515b75d8f5c2beabd5a99fab7e81373a472d0a6c40d9a07d2e55d1",
  "bundle_request_count": 16,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:0c7b505f6366e18528956b6321500333525b62aeb14d0b3953447034804ed11b",
      "request_id": "0c7b505f6366e18528956b6321500333525b62aeb14d0b3953447034804ed11b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "307ffeb5a536b10ddccf5a471f69d020",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二轮对巴西拉什维利，首盘六比一，第二盘却要救四个盘点。抢七六比七落后，这一分轮到他发球。盘分还领先，危险已经来了。他要先救回盘点，再争取结束比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "612ed9c1c0c57a7e456d8c74904671f8b66d64fa61ec8a80940df16bed0c6191",
      "words_sha256": "7b3db2b1a11717e27d6e291883465a074c61e2e3e0d9d3651e625e5d8c7e54f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0e4bfea54ea36b07a986e9b88bbb4d7a4506d3be861e069b20eae91b76ae5258",
      "request_id": "0e4bfea54ea36b07a986e9b88bbb4d7a4506d3be861e069b20eae91b76ae5258",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "61f036f2d6a1e5df9a971e370dccf90e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘，德米纳尔在第二、第四、第八局，都救过破发点。第八局，比分回到平分。他还在争取把局分追成四平。阿卡想要拿走冠军，必须再赢下一次这样的拉锯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9d1b02baefe476dd7be59abb3349b0c6a8611fcfef12dc48ece4ade288447097",
      "words_sha256": "a40f0ca9074bd3cba2b6f4d954aabadcdabe404f6ecc45e298f6ee7dca50e86f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:27a53098d45193c2021c9979878d503ad891bfe7b2a11137c5f1ab4d9c2b7793",
      "request_id": "27a53098d45193c2021c9979878d503ad891bfe7b2a11137c5f1ab4d9c2b7793",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1c2f5e37a9b9a8662ab579213f37f977",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接下来是保罗。对手拿到五个破发点，一个都没能兑现。阿卡六比四、七比六过关。守住的五次机会，也让他把连胜带进半决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c2d006e934ad7bfd2ec5e6b24289d9fb5c972317e7561db85dcf3f7dd2f5a91b",
      "words_sha256": "44ad5baa8ee718831adbf794936381e866bf292f9873711b952cf5571b6b848e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2b27d763d05159c3ce2133bd3e36b14eeff59ad9b959e76db84b2855060815e4",
      "request_id": "2b27d763d05159c3ce2133bd3e36b14eeff59ad9b959e76db84b2855060815e4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5eee5a401eb65badcc4fd716afd0490d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从去年的女王杯，到今天维也纳。五次捧杯，二十六连胜。今年十六胜零负，第十一座五百赛冠军。你更佩服他的进攻，还是关键时刻守住自己的能力？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "809a98a25edf074d877b3ce2ce7e2b81cc547c3b748c8debb8ff1069c334540b",
      "words_sha256": "1ebc68dba50c1e1eb4567b957f2dc5c17113281c8b6700edc96d6d8007d8fc09"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:58e44464599f065196dddd6136d76e33a99df11543fa9ebe241afbe96692a770",
      "request_id": "58e44464599f065196dddd6136d76e33a99df11543fa9ebe241afbe96692a770",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a6380f97c070962d8795221260c75ff1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "来到二零二六年，多哈决赛，他以六比二、六比一战胜菲斯。又是五场胜利，又是一座五百赛冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "881f901449287314c39ff23b6efbf7e002caafdbe80cde074e69363b46456ded",
      "words_sha256": "215f1e2e8f17b2b7e0e3affce0abf8f92661cabe5373f780c50b0322932dafc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:735ebf4d1caec0b4fb23ddb519f89cb39bd8fadb77845109d10f7fc7736c1a1e",
      "request_id": "735ebf4d1caec0b4fb23ddb519f89cb39bd8fadb77845109d10f7fc7736c1a1e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9e28bcbb580aa500634b1e7e7617a310",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德米纳尔随后守住了这一局。阿卡随后保发，五比四。再次接发时，对手从三十比零领先，连丢三分。阿卡第一次拿到冠军点。小球、挑高球、再回到底线，这一分，奖杯要靠最后一次对抗挣出来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b5500af0340f8cdde9ef1e5bbf95794e9448ac8ed48b230d55565139e53d0ead",
      "words_sha256": "b9ff94a2a3fe03f33e49ad1f6bb8b467f7ba7b293dbb52be2c652ecf62d42c26"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:80fa0f0da93f7c881f8ebea4e6bb4a5863d8740c21253b23ca98ad207aa87300",
      "request_id": "80fa0f0da93f7c881f8ebea4e6bb4a5863d8740c21253b23ca98ad207aa87300",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a77482ed6170f27a735d9b9e19d0f43",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可维也纳这一周，比全胜两个字惊险得多。前四场，每一场的第二盘，都要靠抢七结束。首轮对哈恰诺夫，第二盘五比四，阿卡错过三个赛点，反被破发。他随后回破，才把比赛带进抢七。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3b3652657013a8119cd98247b12e53a0220610ee12a484d93ffecada110bc8d5",
      "words_sha256": "b43ae43a5e5d8a6a6e7c80b80af6e9f20acf0e27b15e5f3b5a0c76e9bb48e33c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:858591352c129603eb2d7820aa08ac45a0e978a440c15e706983668b8fd5dec9",
      "request_id": "858591352c129603eb2d7820aa08ac45a0e978a440c15e706983668b8fd5dec9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "09e3ce803cb888848a856b565ba6d457",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月回到东京，他再次五战夺冠。多哈五胜，巴塞罗那一胜，东京五胜，再加这周维也纳五胜，才是今年十六胜零负的完整口径。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "52ac6fd5c894b388a071625caf4607a80a541d520a3de82e9afd46aeec3dca2e",
      "words_sha256": "2ca60abe000ae27d8fb3200883316be6d60692cdd204c1b94f1b589665db715e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:97334bb4e9fadc225f9acc06b01b1654aabd0334ad85c625c82b257a1c7f963d",
      "request_id": "97334bb4e9fadc225f9acc06b01b1654aabd0334ad85c625c82b257a1c7f963d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "92adf38679e2e4f99d4328679bd55994",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从七平，一路打到十三比十一。阿卡直到第四个赛点才拿下比赛。全场没有丢盘，和全场没有危险，完全是两回事。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e5b5a93c2377c2ab8e1b10217b4a4e00ee002e784b2b14bbb3d3e85b75369f75",
      "words_sha256": "be29539a38ddd54fbeb89ebe81b77a48a57fb1aaab02f917ab981f5a607dda76"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a5597208b354a8f666de073f74a0aa63071730ca4dd05816523a9abd4462c4ed",
      "request_id": "a5597208b354a8f666de073f74a0aa63071730ca4dd05816523a9abd4462c4ed",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5cfccc95168c5224c83591ce6e450b09",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这里要说清一个区别。四月的巴塞罗那，他首轮获胜后，因为右手腕伤势，退出第二轮。那一胜仍然计入战绩，赛前退赛不算一场已赛失利。所以，全胜指打过的比赛，不代表每次参赛都拿冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e1c0e93aee9edbf52521be62bcacefea70b39cd23322d38440a9cfff554f0f24",
      "words_sha256": "2d69c5391012e39972158a8177ecfeb0e7ce5f5654217e87a4f15d8aefff4b04"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:aec4c8ad2f654faaa23ab1a0c7329ffdb39089d8a86b523f80ffa0d78c11b50d",
      "request_id": "aec4c8ad2f654faaa23ab1a0c7329ffdb39089d8a86b523f80ffa0d78c11b50d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e75b9accca8022c8fe74ba31d128774d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年，女王杯和东京，他连续两站五战全胜。十场胜利，两座奖杯。换了城市，换了场地，这条连胜还没有停下。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d28e5f39b04bb3ec8c2381e0b0b73f3bce538b7ce9dcb1ddd4a76af57979ed48",
      "words_sha256": "ac1c1e5c9ae6aba275460365ac58024a071dfe77f3b13bd2a4f6b0f15f10f68f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c4e6bb8025950944a4ae39910be1721c37eb2415fefbeb4e787d3235c026d817",
      "request_id": "c4e6bb8025950944a4ae39910be1721c37eb2415fefbeb4e787d3235c026d817",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a2b0aa1c63d532f6cf543cf0e0c6866a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，梅德韦杰夫带着七连胜而来。今年印第安维尔斯，他曾终结阿卡的赛季不败。室内再相遇，阿卡四次争取破发，三次成功，又在第二盘抢七，以七比二收下比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dc08cc53e93d16b7fd90acd4018813e6f05436258bfd8b562dc12a3d614edb9c",
      "words_sha256": "260969ac8bcfc3fa3d8d195bc3f8ade90ed6f39c425f3394b1e842d90b626c4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c94941c7bde088448858ffb1eee3a3b096697b3a755a08e828d731fe055dfd69",
      "request_id": "c94941c7bde088448858ffb1eee3a3b096697b3a755a08e828d731fe055dfd69",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8e15a082e0e96dcbb16e6e2bdb44a51b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，德米纳尔带着今年室内十战全胜的战绩。他开局就被破发，却没有轻易交出比赛。首盘七局，五局打到平分；阿卡在这些拉锯中三次破发，才拿下六比一。这个比分，藏住了不少对抗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "46724ff48c60d7e754f3d66081ab3b84acffb91e3663b69c0185497505b1ea03",
      "words_sha256": "787d931c1edbcdb84e6d6956a97257fd63c6ec837b61a2c7ff9f6a829f255a97"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d9e26eab0c7b18d67a67f5f27fd55830f0048fe6444e47489d30d68584440632",
      "request_id": "d9e26eab0c7b18d67a67f5f27fd55830f0048fe6444e47489d30d68584440632",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a0250da8154f1958ea4f31c4f7800d3f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至维也纳夺冠，阿卡今年在五百级赛事十六胜零负。跨赛季，则是二十六连胜。上一次在这个级别输球，还是去年巴塞罗那决赛对鲁内。先从几座奖杯，看这条连胜的来路。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6c747866f9fdf1e274f4bb0274426c9e5699914cf90c1073067bf3ab2072a2a2",
      "words_sha256": "2e9c78ed205c6aa724f722da8f5fcb4fe1caa1f7bf0bad4b0bb74864f24301c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f2c7c5eef19d3cc858fbe3f39e83077a2625698b995886135a83206f113d849d",
      "request_id": "f2c7c5eef19d3cc858fbe3f39e83077a2625698b995886135a83206f113d849d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "53d7b08725bd46148f73194a241dc9f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿卡500赛全胜，26连胜藏着险关。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c4667154bd309fc9792f940c13a69db0467dd776098fcf6caf8b9c59a89ad6f9",
      "words_sha256": "52fc522c2a9ec7753de688fd57e95181b774c42b3dfb1614b99d9d3db7a11a4d"
    },
