        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这里要说清一个区别。四月的巴塞罗那，他首轮获胜后，因为右手腕伤势，退出第二轮。那一胜仍然计入战绩，赛前退赛不算一场已赛失利。所以，全胜指打过的比赛，不代表每次参赛都拿冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "52ac6fd5c894b388a071625caf4607a80a541d520a3de82e9afd46aeec3dca2e",
      "words_sha256": "2ca60abe000ae27d8fb3200883316be6d60692cdd204c1b94f1b589665db715e",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "09e3ce803cb888848a856b565ba6d457",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月回到东京，他再次五战夺冠。多哈五胜，巴塞罗那一胜，东京五胜，再加这周维也纳五胜，才是今年十六胜零负的完整口径。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3b3652657013a8119cd98247b12e53a0220610ee12a484d93ffecada110bc8d5",
      "words_sha256": "b43ae43a5e5d8a6a6e7c80b80af6e9f20acf0e27b15e5f3b5a0c76e9bb48e33c",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6a77482ed6170f27a735d9b9e19d0f43",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可维也纳这一周，比全胜两个字惊险得多。前四场，每一场的第二盘，都要靠抢七结束。首轮对哈恰诺夫，第二盘五比四，阿卡错过三个赛点，反被破发。他随后回破，才把比赛带进抢七。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "612ed9c1c0c57a7e456d8c74904671f8b66d64fa61ec8a80940df16bed0c6191",
      "words_sha256": "7b3db2b1a11717e27d6e291883465a074c61e2e3e0d9d3651e625e5d8c7e54f4",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "307ffeb5a536b10ddccf5a471f69d020",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二轮对巴西拉什维利，首盘六比一，第二盘却要救四个盘点。抢七六比七落后，这一分轮到他发球。盘分还领先，危险已经来了。他要先救回盘点，再争取结束比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e5b5a93c2377c2ab8e1b10217b4a4e00ee002e784b2b14bbb3d3e85b75369f75",
      "words_sha256": "be29539a38ddd54fbeb89ebe81b77a48a57fb1aaab02f917ab981f5a607dda76",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "92adf38679e2e4f99d4328679bd55994",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从七平，一路打到十三比十一。阿卡直到第四个赛点才拿下比赛。全场没有丢盘，和全场没有危险，完全是两回事。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c2d006e934ad7bfd2ec5e6b24289d9fb5c972317e7561db85dcf3f7dd2f5a91b",
      "words_sha256": "44ad5baa8ee718831adbf794936381e866bf292f9873711b952cf5571b6b848e",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1c2f5e37a9b9a8662ab579213f37f977",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接下来是保罗。对手拿到五个破发点，一个都没能兑现。阿卡六比四、七比六过关。守住的五次机会，也让他把连胜带进半决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dc08cc53e93d16b7fd90acd4018813e6f05436258bfd8b562dc12a3d614edb9c",
      "words_sha256": "260969ac8bcfc3fa3d8d195bc3f8ade90ed6f39c425f3394b1e842d90b626c4b",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a2b0aa1c63d532f6cf543cf0e0c6866a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，梅德韦杰夫带着七连胜而来。今年印第安维尔斯，他曾终结阿卡的赛季不败。室内再相遇，阿卡四次争取破发，三次成功，又在第二盘抢七，以七比二收下比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "46724ff48c60d7e754f3d66081ab3b84acffb91e3663b69c0185497505b1ea03",
      "words_sha256": "787d931c1edbcdb84e6d6956a97257fd63c6ec837b61a2c7ff9f6a829f255a97",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8e15a082e0e96dcbb16e6e2bdb44a51b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，德米纳尔带着今年室内十战全胜的战绩。他开局就被破发，却没有轻易交出比赛。首盘七局，五局打到平分；阿卡在这些拉锯中三次破发，才拿下六比一。这个比分，藏住了不少对抗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9d1b02baefe476dd7be59abb3349b0c6a8611fcfef12dc48ece4ade288447097",
      "words_sha256": "a40f0ca9074bd3cba2b6f4d954aabadcdabe404f6ecc45e298f6ee7dca50e86f",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "61f036f2d6a1e5df9a971e370dccf90e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘，德米纳尔在第二、第四、第八局，都救过破发点。第八局，比分回到平分。他还在争取把局分追成四平。阿卡想要拿走冠军，必须再赢下一次这样的拉锯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b5500af0340f8cdde9ef1e5bbf95794e9448ac8ed48b230d55565139e53d0ead",
      "words_sha256": "b9ff94a2a3fe03f33e49ad1f6bb8b467f7ba7b293dbb52be2c652ecf62d42c26",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9e28bcbb580aa500634b1e7e7617a310",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德米纳尔随后守住了这一局。阿卡随后保发，五比四。再次接发时，对手从三十比零领先，连丢三分。阿卡第一次拿到冠军点。小球、挑高球、再回到底线，这一分，奖杯要靠最后一次对抗挣出来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "809a98a25edf074d877b3ce2ce7e2b81cc547c3b748c8debb8ff1069c334540b",
      "words_sha256": "1ebc68dba50c1e1eb4567b957f2dc5c17113281c8b6700edc96d6d8007d8fc09",
      "words_path": "voice_25.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5eee5a401eb65badcc4fd716afd0490d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从去年的女王杯，到今天维也纳。五次捧杯，二十六连胜。今年十六胜零负，第十一座五百赛冠军。你更佩服他的进攻，还是关键时刻守住自己的能力？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c4667154bd309fc9792f940c13a69db0467dd776098fcf6caf8b9c59a89ad6f9",
      "words_sha256": "52fc522c2a9ec7753de688fd57e95181b774c42b3dfb1614b99d9d3db7a11a4d",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "53d7b08725bd46148f73194a241dc9f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿卡500赛全胜，26连胜藏着险关。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
